---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<div class="container mx-auto px-4">
			<div class="hero bg-base-200 rounded-box my-8 py-10">
				<div class="hero-content text-center">
					<div class="max-w-md">
						<h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-primary">🧑‍🚀 Hello, Astronaut!</h1>
						<p class="py-6">
							Welcome to the official <a href="https://astro.build/" class="link link-primary">Astro</a> blog starter template. This
							template serves as a lightweight, minimally-styled starting point for anyone looking to build
							a personal website, blog, or portfolio with Astro.
						</p>
						<button class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<main class="prose lg:prose-xl mx-auto mb-10">
				<div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl mb-8">
					<div class="card-body">
						<h2 class="card-title">About this template</h2>
						<p>
							This template comes with a few integrations already configured in your
							<code class="bg-base-200 px-2 py-1 rounded">astro.config.mjs</code> file. You can customize your setup with
							<a href="https://astro.build/integrations" class="link link-primary">Astro Integrations</a> to add tools like Tailwind,
							React, or Vue to your project.
						</p>
						<div class="alert alert-info shadow-lg mt-4">
							<div>
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="stroke-current flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
								<span>Have fun! If you get stuck, remember to <a href="https://docs.astro.build/" class="link">read the docs</a> or <a href="https://astro.build/chat" class="link">join us on Discord</a> to ask questions.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
					<div class="card-body">
						<h2 class="card-title">Getting Started</h2>
						<p>Here are a few ideas on how to get started with the template:</p>
						<ul class="menu bg-base-200 w-full p-2 rounded-box">
							<li><a>Edit this page in <code>src/pages/index.astro</code></a></li>
							<li><a>Edit the site header items in <code>src/components/Header.astro</code></a></li>
							<li><a>Add your name to the footer in <code>src/components/Footer.astro</code></a></li>
							<li><a>Check out the included blog posts in <code>src/content/blog/</code></a></li>
							<li><a>Customize the blog post page layout in <code>src/layouts/BlogPost.astro</code></a></li>
						</ul>

						<div class="divider">Other templates</div>
						<p>
							Looking for a blog template with a bit more personality? Check out
							<a href="https://github.com/Charca/astro-blog-template" class="link link-primary">astro-blog-template</a>
							by <a href="https://twitter.com/Charca" class="link">Maxi Ferreira</a>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</main>
		</div>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
